      "title": "wmem: Add some comments about not using wmem_map with NULL allocator",
      "message": "wmem: Add some comments about not using wmem_map with NULL allocator\n\nwmem_map, like wmem_tree, is not really intended for use with a NULL\nallocator scope. (In particular, wmem_map_new_autoreset really won't\nwork.) Add some warnings in the header about that. Also make\nwmem_map_new at least not crash if a NULL scope is used.\n",
